  "deep_protocol": "Prime an identical 261120-token document, then run two waves of 32 independent active reservations with 1024 reply tokens each. Fixed per-stream seeds 9000+i, temperature 1, no growth, stock C32 monitor. Wall throughput includes per-wave restore, residual prefill, and decode. The minimum available memory is sampled Linux MemAvailable per host. Engine active bytes are the head allocator counter before and after the full-window phase, after the shorter waves.",
