  "short_protocol": "Published synthetic kit prompt set B via /tokenize with thinking off and a distinct variant suffix per stream. 32-way barrier, 160 reply tokens, ignore_eos, seed 42000+i. Code/prose/counting greedy; mixed cycles through those three at temperature 1. One mixed warmup of 64 tokens, one C1 smoke, two scored repetitions in opposite workload orders, and one sampled ordinary control. Steady throughput counts committed output only in adjacent observations at C32 with no prefill or queue. All startups used the same binaries, base image and prices through row 48. The first 64-row policy estimated higher costs proportionally. The 64-curve policy used the normalized upstream measurements for rows 49-64.",
